#. : What each button is called, singular and plural. A button is renamed as the
#. : selection it acts on grows past one and shrinks back again, so both names are
#. : needed at once.
#. Translators: the button that takes the current application off the autosleep list.
msgid "&Remove"
msgstr "&Odstrániť"

#. Translators: the button that takes several selected applications off the autosleep list.
msgid "&Remove selected"
msgstr "&Odstrániť vybrané"

#. Translators: the button that puts the current application on the autosleep list.
msgid "&Add"
msgstr "&Pridať"

#. Translators: the button that puts several selected applications on the autosleep list.
msgid "&Add selected"
msgstr "&Pridať vybrané"

#. Translators: the title of the add-on's category in NVDA's Settings dialog.
#. Translators: the category this add-on's commands are listed under in the
#. Input gestures dialog.
#. Add-on summary/title, usually the user visible name of the add-on
#. Translators: Summary/title for this add-on
#. to be shown on installation and add-on information found in add-on store
msgid "Autosleep Mode"
msgstr "Automatický režim spánku"

#. Translators: the label of the list of applications that are put to sleep automatically.
msgid "Apps to &sleep"
msgstr "Aplikácie na &uspatie"

#. Translators: the label of the list of applications that are running now and
#. can be added to the autosleep list.
msgid "A&vailable apps"
msgstr "&Dostupné aplikácie"

#. Translators: an option to grow the list from the applications slept by hand.
msgid "Add apps with &manually activated sleep mode to the autosleep list"
msgstr "Pridávať &ručne uspané aplikácie do zoznamu na automatické uspatie"

#. Translators: an option to shrink the list by the applications woken by hand.
msgid "Remove &manually woken apps from the autosleep list"
msgstr "Odoberať &ručne prebudené aplikácie zo zoznamu na automatické uspatie"

#. Translators: how an application NVDA is currently asleep in is shown in
#. both lists of applications. {app} is the name of the application.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{app} (sleeping)"
msgstr "{app} (uspané)"

#. Translators: the description of the command that opens the add-on's
#. settings, shown in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Displays autosleep mode settings"
msgstr "Zobrazí nastavenia automatického režimu spánku"

#. Translators: announced right after NVDA's own "Sleep mode on" or
#. "Sleep mode off" when that toggle has just put the application on the
#. autosleep list or taken it off it.
msgid "Saved"
msgstr "Uložené"

msgid ""
"Turns NVDA's sleep mode on automatically whenever an application you have "
"listed comes to the foreground."
msgstr ""
"Automaticky zapne režim spánku NVDA vždy, keď sa do popredia dostane "
"niektorá z vybraných aplikácií."

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
msgid "Initial release"
msgstr "Prvá verzia"
